{https://github.com/SprintStartProject/sprintstart-backend/issues/149}[#149]

* What's needed 
  - `POST /api/v1/jira/connect` with body including url
  - `GET /api/v1/jira/{instance}`
  - `POST/PUT/PATCH /api/v1/jira/{instance}/update`

  - `PUT/PATCH /api/v1/jira/configure/{id}` with body including schedule, autoupdate
  - `GET /api/v1/jira/{instance}/config` - maybe merge with overall get

  - `POST /api/v1/jira/token` with body including token, token name
  - `PUT/PATCH /api/v1/jira/{tokenName}` with body including new token / new token name
  - `GET /api/v1/jira/{tokenName}`

** The service
*** Connect a JIRA instance
    - Body: `ConnectJiraInstanceRequest`
    @code json
        {
          "name": "asd",
          "url": "asd",
          "tokenName": "asd",
          "projectId": "asd"
        }
    @end

    - Fetches following data types:
    -- Issues
    --- Query specific issue
        `GET /rest/api/3/issue/{issueId}` for retrieving a specific issue
    --- Query all issues
        `GET /rest/api/3/search` using JQL for searching all issues or with filter for project etc
    -- Changelogs
       `GET /rest/api/3/issue/{issueId}/changelog` or `expand=true` on JQL
    -- Users
     --- Query specific user
         `GET /rest/api/3/user`
    --- Query all users
        `GET /rest/api/3/users/search`
    -- fields

    -- projects


